    {
      "title": "Raising his spirit",
      "text": "Talk to repeatedly to raise his spirits:\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eOf the four chat options, choose the one that appears on the table below.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eSelect the response according to the table.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eRepeat until a short cutscene plays and he sits up.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e",
      "actions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "You seem like a nice guy."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Just being honest."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "When we get out of here I\u0027ll buy you a drink!"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Whatever and wherever you want - my treat."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "I\u0027m very impressed you managed to get into this cave."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "I would have given up personally."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "You\u0027ll survive this easily."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Think of all the places you can visit when you get out!"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "What are you going to do when you get out of here?"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "That\u0027s up to you. You could travel with me!"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "It\u0027s a good thing you have me to look after you."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Not that I\u0027m bragging or anything."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Not long now and you\u0027ll be back on your feet!"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "On whether you mind me helping you further."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "You\u0027re sounding much better."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "If you need anything, just let me know."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "It\u0027s quite cosy in here."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "The perfect environment for getting back on your feet!"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "You\u0027re very safe in this little cave."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "The suqah will never fit through that tunnel."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Just don\u0027t worry."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Of course."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "You\u0027re looking better now."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Well, you look and sound more lively."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Are you looking forward to getting out?"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "That\u0027s the spirit!"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Tell me a bit about yourself."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Fishing!"
        },
        {
          "t": "modelHighlight",
          "kind": "npc",
          "typeId": 436,
          "modelIds": [],
          "displayName": "Fallen Man"
        },
        {
          "t": "modelHighlight",
          "kind": "npc",
          "typeId": 5893,
          "modelIds": [],
          "displayName": "Cyrisus"
        }
      ],
      "postconditions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationText",
          "text": "I remember, I was on the island"
